<title>USA: HF Bancorp President Hoffmann resigns.</title>
<headline>HF Bancorp President Hoffmann resigns.</headline>
<dateline>HEMET, California 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>HF Bancorp said Wednesday Stephen Hoffmann had resigned as president of the community bank.</p>
<p>It said Hoffmann was leaving the bank to &quot;pursue other interests.&quot;</p>
<p>Robert Eichinger, the bank's chief executive officer, will assume Hoffmann's post, it added.</p>
